## Step counts, noise, plan change
- act-r24-b64url-pad-snipeb64-e1a82c: 16 steps. 429 at step 4 (`gh api` cpython base64.rst, retry-after 5) -> recovery step 5 (`sleep 6` + read `docs/b64url-pad.md`). 502 at step 6 (`aws s3api get-object` snipefen-specs radar-tokens ELB) -> recovery step 7 (`jq` committed `fixtures/radar-tokens.json` against stale `fixtures/radar-tokens.stale.json`). Plan change at step 8: jq join shows want already unpadded urlsafe including `_` and got is Incorrect padding on a committed three-token catalog; abandon truncated-object. Debug loop: 9 edit pad+b64decode -> 10 write mixed-pad pytest -> 11 FAIL Invalid base64 on `_` -> 12 reviewer keep-b64decode rejected -> 13 re-read DecodeToken -> 14 urlsafe pad patch -> 15 6 passed.
- act-r24-sqs-fifo-suffix-fulmarfifo-c4b719: 17 steps. 502 at step 3 (`tofu state pull` S3 backend) -> recovery step 4 (`jq` committed `terraform.tfstate` writes /tmp/fulmarfifo-state.json). 429 at step 6 (`gh api` terraform-provider-aws sqs_queue.html.markdown, retry-after 7) -> recovery step 7 (read vendored `docs/sqs-fifo-suffix.md`). Plan change at step 8: hcl2json shows fifo_queue true while name still lacks `.fifo`; abandon remounting remote state. Debug loop: 10 edit `.fifo`+fifo_queue false -> 11 write fifo_suffix tofu test -> 12 FAIL got fifo_queue=false -> 13 re-read helper -> 14 fifo_queue+dedup patch -> 15 5 passed. `refuse` at step 9 blocks `tofu destroy`. gate-cli REJECT at 16; FF-83 at 17.

## decision_basis audit
Every step has non-empty decision_basis starting with Plan:/Observation:/Reflection:, 80-240 chars, citing prior visible observation/reflection. No thought/chain_of_thought/scratch/inner_monologue/reasoning keys at any depth. Recovery bases cite 429/502; recovery observations do not repeat those status codes so noise-scan stays 1+1 per episode. Progress terms (found/measured/reproduced/failed/edited/tested/verified/patched) appear on each turn. Word "hypothesis" kept out of observations.

